<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Earn with Pay2View</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #000;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ad-container {
      max-width: 420px;
      width: 90%;
      background: #111;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #ccc;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    ul li {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: #222;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    ul li::before {
      content: "💰";
    }

    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 13px 26px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #aaa;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="ad-container">

    <h2>Hello {{username}}</h2>
    <h2>Pay2View is a Tool — Not a Platform</h2>

    <p>
      Pay2View doesn’t give you an audience.  
      It gives you a <strong>tool</strong> to make money from the audience you already have.
    </p>

    <p>
      Creators, educators, and hustlers are using Pay2View to lock content behind a paywall
      and earn whenever someone views it — some consistently earning hundreds of thousands of naira.
    </p>

    <p><strong>What Pay2View lets you do:</strong></p>

    <ul>
      <li>Upload videos, tutorials, PDFs, or exclusive content</li>
      <li>Lock content so viewers must pay to access it</li>
      <li>Generate a unique paid link instantly</li>
      <li>Share your link on WhatsApp, Telegram, X, Instagram, or anywhere</li>
      <li>Track views, payments, and earnings in your dashboard</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      You focus on creating and sharing.  
      Pay2View handles payments, access control, and tracking.
    </p>

    <a href="https://www.pay2view.io" class="cta" target="_blank">
      Start Using the Tool
    </a>

    <div class="footer-note">
      Pay2View © 2026 — Monetise your content your way
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
